# Naming and File Structure Conventions

## File and Folder Names

| Type | Format | Example |
|------|--------|---------|
| Component file | PascalCase | `ThreadCard.tsx`, `UserAvatar.tsx` |
| Page/layout | kebab-case (required by Next.js) | `page.tsx`, `not-found.tsx` |
| Server action | camelCase | `threadActions.ts`, `postActions.ts` |
| Query file | camelCase | `threadQueries.ts`, `userQueries.ts` |
| Util/lib | camelCase | `formatDate.ts`, `slugify.ts` |
| Type file | camelCase | `thread.types.ts` |
| Hook | camelCase, `use` prefix | `useSession.ts`, `useInfiniteScroll.ts` |

## Variable and Function Names

- Variables and functions: `camelCase`
- Components and types/interfaces: `PascalCase`
- Constants (immutable values): `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`
- Boolean variables must start with `is`, `has`, `can`, `should`: `isLoading`, `hasPermission`
- Event handlers with `handle` prefix: `handleSubmit`, `handleDelete`

## Server Action Naming

All server actions follow the `verb + Model` format:

```ts
// src/server/actions/threadActions.ts
export async function createThread(...) {}
export async function updateThread(...) {}
export async function deleteThread(...) {}
export async function pinThread(...) {}
export async function lockThread(...) {}
```

## Query Function Naming

```ts
// src/server/queries/threadQueries.ts
export async function getThreadBySlug(...) {}
export async function getThreadsByCategory(...) {}
export async function getThreadCount(...) {}
```

## Component Prop Naming

- Callback props with `on` prefix: `onSubmit`, `onDelete`, `onClose`
- Render props with `render` prefix: `renderHeader`
- Boolean props with `is/has/can`: `isLoading`, `isDisabled`

## Folder Structure Conventions

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── (auth)/              # Route group — auth pages
│   │   ├── login/
│   │   └── register/
│   ├── (forum)/             # Route group — forum pages
│   │   ├── c/[slug]/        # Category page
│   │   └── t/[slug]/        # Thread page
│   └── admin/               # Admin panel
│       └── _components/     # Admin-only components
├── components/
│   ├── ui/                  # shadcn/ui (do not touch)
│   ├── forum/               # Forum-specific components
│   └── shared/              # Shared general components
├── server/
│   ├── actions/             # Server Actions (mutations)
│   ├── queries/             # DB read functions
│   └── validations/         # Zod schemas
└── lib/
    ├── db.ts                # Prisma singleton
    ├── auth.ts              # Better Auth config
    ├── env.ts               # Environment validation
    └── utils.ts             # cn() and general utils
```

## Import Order

```ts
// 1. React/Next.js
import { Suspense } from "react"
import { notFound } from "next/navigation"

// 2. External packages
import { z } from "zod"

// 3. Internal modules (with @/ alias)
import { db } from "@/lib/db"
import { ThreadCard } from "@/components/forum/ThreadCard"

// 4. Type imports
import type { Thread } from "@/types/thread.types"
```
